### ===========================================
### TESTS DE COMUNIDADES - Events Service
### ===========================================
### Prerequisitos:
### - Auth service corriendo en :8000
### - Events service corriendo en :8001
### 
### Credenciales de test:
### - Admin: dragonavensito@gmail.com / Aa123456.
### - Usuario: juan.perez@universidad.edu.mx / MiContraseña2026!
### ===========================================

### Variables
@authUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000
@eventsUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8001

### ===========================================
### 1. AUTENTICACIÓN - Obtener tokens
### ===========================================

### Login Admin (dragonavensito@gmail.com)
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{authUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=dragonavensito@gmail.com&password=Aa123456

### Login Usuario (juan.perez@universidad.edu.mx)
# @name loginUser
POST {{authUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=juan.perez@universidad.edu.mx&password=MiContraseña2026!

### ===========================================
### 2. COMUNIDADES - CRUD Básico
### ===========================================

### 2.1 Crear comunidad (Usuario normal)
# @name createCommunity
POST {{eventsUrl}}/api/v1/communities
Authorization: Bearer {{loginUser.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Runners Monterrey Test",
  "description": "Comunidad de corredores del área metropolitana de Monterrey para eventos de running y trail.",
  "image_url": null,
  "contact_email": "runners.mty@test.com",
  "is_accepted_terms": true,
  "social_links": {
    "whatsapp": "https://wa.me/528112345678",
    "facebook": "https://facebook.com/runnersmty",
    "instagram": "https://instagram.com/runnersmty"
  }
}

### 2.2 Listar comunidades activas (público)
GET {{eventsUrl}}/api/v1/communities
Content-Type: application/json

### 2.3 Listar mis comunidades (usuario autenticado)
GET {{eventsUrl}}/api/v1/communities/my
Authorization: Bearer {{loginUser.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 2.4 Obtener detalle de comunidad
GET {{eventsUrl}}/api/v1/communities/{{createCommunity.response.body.data.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

### ===========================================
### 3. ADMIN - Moderación de comunidades
### ===========================================

### 3.1 Admin: Listar todas las comunidades
GET {{eventsUrl}}/api/v1/admin/communities
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 3.2 Admin: Listar comunidades PENDING
GET {{eventsUrl}}/api/v1/admin/communities?status=PENDING
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 3.3 Admin: Aprobar comunidad
PATCH {{eventsUrl}}/api/v1/admin/communities/{{createCommunity.response.body.data.id}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "ACTIVATE"
}

### 3.4 Verificar comunidad ahora está ACTIVE (público)
GET {{eventsUrl}}/api/v1/communities
Content-Type: application/json

### ===========================================
### 4. EVENTOS CON SOCIAL LINKS Y COMUNIDAD
### ===========================================

### 4.1 Crear evento con social_links y community_id
# @name createEventWithCommunity
POST {{eventsUrl}}/api/v1/events
Authorization: Bearer {{loginUser.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Carrera 10K Fundidora Test",
  "description": "Gran carrera de 10 kilómetros en el Parque Fundidora. Evento de prueba para la comunidad de runners.",
  "start_datetime": "2026-05-15T07:00:00Z",
  "end_datetime": "2026-05-15T12:00:00Z",
  "location": "Parque Fundidora, Monterrey",
  "category_id": 1,
  "social_links": {
    "whatsapp": "https://wa.me/528119876543",
    "instagram": "https://instagram.com/carrera10k"
  },
  "community_id": "{{createCommunity.response.body.data.id}}"
}

### 4.2 Verificar evento creado tiene social_links
GET {{eventsUrl}}/api/v1/events/{{createEventWithCommunity.response.body.data.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

### ===========================================
### 5. SOLICITUDES DE EVENTOS A COMUNIDAD
### ===========================================

### 5.1 Crear otro evento sin comunidad
# @name createEventNoCommunity
POST {{eventsUrl}}/api/v1/events
Authorization: Bearer {{loginUser.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Trail Running Chipinque",
  "description": "Carrera de trail running en la sierra de Chipinque",
  "start_datetime": "2026-06-01T06:00:00Z",
  "end_datetime": "2026-06-01T14:00:00Z",
  "location": "Parque Ecológico Chipinque",
  "category_id": 1
}

### 5.2 Solicitar que evento se una a comunidad
POST {{eventsUrl}}/api/v1/communities/{{createCommunity.response.body.data.id}}/events/{{createEventNoCommunity.response.body.data.id}}/request
Authorization: Bearer {{loginUser.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 5.3 Owner de comunidad: Ver solicitudes pendientes
GET {{eventsUrl}}/api/v1/communities/{{createCommunity.response.body.data.id}}/requests?status=PENDING
Authorization: Bearer {{loginUser.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 5.4 Owner de comunidad: Aprobar solicitud
# Nota: Reemplazar {request_id} con el ID de la solicitud obtenido en 5.3
PATCH {{eventsUrl}}/api/v1/communities/{{createCommunity.response.body.data.id}}/requests/{request_id}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginUser.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "APPROVE"
}

### 5.5 Ver schedule de la comunidad (eventos aprobados)
GET {{eventsUrl}}/api/v1/communities/{{createCommunity.response.body.data.id}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

### ===========================================
### 6. SISTEMA DE BANEOS
### ===========================================

### 6.1 Admin: Banear usuario
POST {{eventsUrl}}/api/v1/admin/users/test-user-id-to-ban/ban
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Test de baneo - violación de normas"
}

### 6.2 Admin: Listar usuarios baneados
GET {{eventsUrl}}/api/v1/admin/users/banned
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 6.3 Admin: Verificar estado de baneo de usuario
GET {{eventsUrl}}/api/v1/admin/users/test-user-id-to-ban/ban-status
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 6.4 Admin: Desbanear usuario
DELETE {{eventsUrl}}/api/v1/admin/users/test-user-id-to-ban/ban
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### ===========================================
### 7. ACTUALIZACIÓN DE COMUNIDAD
### ===========================================

### 7.1 Actualizar comunidad (solo owner)
PATCH {{eventsUrl}}/api/v1/communities/{{createCommunity.response.body.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginUser.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Comunidad ACTUALIZADA de corredores del área metropolitana de Monterrey",
  "social_links": {
    "whatsapp": "https://wa.me/528199999999",
    "facebook": "https://facebook.com/runnersmonterrey",
    "instagram": "https://instagram.com/runnersmonterrey"
  }
}

### ===========================================
### 8. CASOS DE ERROR ESPERADOS
### ===========================================

### 8.1 Error: Crear comunidad sin aceptar términos
POST {{eventsUrl}}/api/v1/communities
Authorization: Bearer {{loginUser.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Comunidad Sin Términos",
  "description": "Esta comunidad no aceptó los términos",
  "contact_email": "test@test.com",
  "is_accepted_terms": false
}

### 8.2 Error: Nombre de comunidad duplicado
POST {{eventsUrl}}/api/v1/communities
Authorization: Bearer {{loginUser.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Runners Monterrey Test",
  "description": "Intentando crear comunidad con nombre duplicado",
  "contact_email": "test@test.com",
  "is_accepted_terms": true
}

### 8.3 Error: Usuario sin rol admin intenta aprobar comunidad
PATCH {{eventsUrl}}/api/v1/admin/communities/{{createCommunity.response.body.data.id}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{loginUser.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "ACTIVATE"
}

### 8.4 Error: Social link con formato inválido
POST {{eventsUrl}}/api/v1/communities
Authorization: Bearer {{loginUser.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Comunidad Link Invalido",
  "description": "Probando validación de social links",
  "contact_email": "test@test.com",
  "is_accepted_terms": true,
  "social_links": {
    "whatsapp": "http://invalid-whatsapp-link.com"
  }
}

### ===========================================
### 9. HEALTH CHECK
### ===========================================

### Health check Events Service
GET {{eventsUrl}}/api/health

### Health check Auth Service  
GET {{authUrl}}/api/health
